# Development Workflow

For every implementation:

1. Understand the requirement
2. Review existing structure and related files
3. Search for reusable code and assets (`docs/knowledge/REUSABLE_INVENTORY.md`)
4. Plan against PRD/scope and design mocks
5. Build or extend reusable pieces first
6. Implement the feature
7. Verify responsiveness (mobile → XL)
8. Verify design-system consistency (tokens / utilities)
9. Update progress docs (`PROGRESS.md`, `FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md`, `DECISIONS.md`, inventory as needed)

Never assume functionality exists — verify first. Prefer reuse over duplication. Keep diffs focused.
